{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122101","id":4207204219,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc76xNd7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122101","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122101.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122101.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122101","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122101/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122101/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122101/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4eddb657e2bf3f9cae05ac109a03b9b651a460df","number":122101,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Do not translate errors from GDScript's utility functions","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ever since the dawn of time of this repository, errors sent by GDScript's utility functions (`range`, `ord`, `len`, etc.) were made to be translated, and thus appear on Weblate like any other string.\r\nAcross the whole engine, this has been a huge exception and quite the oddity.\r\nThese kinds of errors are never, ever translated. Imagine changing the language of a game and the errors in the log also being in a whole other language. Contrary to what it may seem, it makes troubleshooting and asking for assistance much harder.\r\n\r\nThis PR removes the `RTR` macro from around these messages, and also tweaks them slightly while at it.\r\n\r\nSee also the [remark on RocketChat](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/translation?msg=HyWKZXNNkQyrEBXs8):\r\n> but yeah, they shouldn't be translated. We don't translate stuff that's printed to console, only what appears in the UI\r\n\r\nI'm surprised no one noticed or cared until now. It's weird.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8133949121,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB5NI2wQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:i18n","name":"topic:i18n","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky"